# Test leftover cleanup (mandatory)

Do **not** run `kill`, `pkill`, or `killall` against `critical_zoomer`,
`workgroup_fitness`, `Xvfb`, or `/tmp/cz_*` sessions. Those commands trip
safety/Auto-review prompts and are unnecessary.

Cleanup is automatic:

- `.cursor/hooks.json` runs `.cursor/hooks/kill-test-zombies.sh` before/after
  `cargo test`, `cargo bench`, and `xvfb_screenshot_check`, and on agent `stop`
- `.cursor/hooks/guard-raw-kill.sh` **blocks** raw kill/pkill for those targets
  and runs the safe reaper instead

If you need an explicit sweep, run **only**:

```bash
.cursor/hooks/kill-test-zombies.sh
```

Log: `/tmp/cz_zombie_kill.log`. Never invent ad-hoc pkill one-liners.
